Third-party work reimplemented in this product
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

git-graph — https://github.com/git-bahn/git-graph
Copyright (c) 2021 Martin Lange
Licensed under the MIT License.

  The branching-model approach used to arrange the commit graph — classifying
  refs into branch classes (main, develop, release, hotfix, bugfix, feature)
  and deriving each lane's column order and colour from that class, so
  persistent branches keep the left-most lanes — follows git-graph. The C++
  implementation in core/src/vcs/branch_model.cpp is original; no source was
  copied.

